{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Hell</strong>\u00a0is a\u00a0<strong>first-person, high-stakes, casino-based puzzle game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning in debt, you are offered a way out by taking on a gauntlet of high-stakes gambles at The Kursaal casino. Outsmart cheating opponents by reading their tells, spotting hidden tricks, and turning their schemes against them. Beat the gauntlet and free yourself of debt, or risk drowning in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Gamble is Unique:</strong>\u00a0Compete in a variety of games against quirky opponents, ranging from casino classics like pachinko to playground favorites such as Simon Says.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing Is As It Seems:</strong>\u00a0Don't depend on honest competition! The rules are rigged against you and breaking them is your only path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect The Dots:</strong> In a world designed to mislead and confuse, can you grasp the underlying threads tying the opponents of this mysterious casino together?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086790?t=1764082184","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086790?t=1764082184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086790/43efc68ac8dfad8d9505caca78540db7b99f91eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764082184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086790/43efc68ac8dfad8d9505caca78540db7b99f91eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764082184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","